        "quote": "(a) The Transportation Operations Superintendent may establish rates for the use of the City’s off-street parking garages and parking lots within the following minimum and maximum ranges:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.390:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
